00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:13.980
GMTea


00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:14.240
GMTeam


00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:14.500
GMTeam m


00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:14.760
GMTeam mo


00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:15.020
GMTeam mov


00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:15.280
GMTeam movi


00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:15.670
